      "title": "Qt: Set Packet List autoscroll off",
      "message": "Qt: Set Packet List autoscroll off\n\nWe generally want Qt (horizontal) auto scroll off in the Packet List\n(56625dd4562d89f711ab68caa8cf849509b0970f) but reverted that change\nin (df83e45084f7a8430225f646a03d1974b188d3ca) because we needed to\nscroll vertically for Go To Packet and a few other cases when selecting\na packet, and auto scrolling did that for us.\n\nCommit 97ae7cdf2fa1172ae6e0bcb6533bcb8a6b3b085e made it so that\nwe manually position the selected packet at the center, so we\ncan turn autoScroll off since we're doing it ourselves.\n\nBy doing so, we can remove our workarounds for preventing horizontal\nautoscroll.\n\nFix #19551\n",
